      "cooked": "<p>I’m interested to get other players’ sense of Plague Rat in terms of whether or not he flips. We played against him tonight and managed to win with him never flipping.</p>\n<p>We were in the Pike Industrial Complex. Mr. Fixer’s style of making all other heroes’ damage irreducible against a single target turned out to be incredibly useful. The biomemetic vat was reducing all damage. Everyone was targeting just Mr. Fixer.</p>\n<p>I also got to play three Lightspeed Barages in one turn. Only seven points each, but still pretty awesome.</p>",
